---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AuthorBio from '../components/AuthorBio.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const legalDate = '2026-10-19';
const legalDateLabel = 'October 19, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy - SuretyResearch"
  description="What SuretyResearch collects, which tools load with the site, and how to ask about information we hold."
  dateModified={legalDate}
  updatedLabel={legalDateLabel}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Housekeeping</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>Last updated {legalDateLabel}</p>
      <AuthorBio />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        SuretyResearch is a static research site. The premium sketch runs in your browser and is not sent to us. This site does not use a lead form. Directory questions go to {SITE.email}.
      </p>
      <p>
        A call to Integrity First Insurance or a Cornerstone site reaches that firm. Use the privacy notice on the site you reach.
      </p>

      <h2>Tools we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Cloudflare Pages serves the site.</li>
        <li>Fonts load from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address and browser details when your browser requests them.</li>
        <li>We count page views with Cloudflare Web Analytics. It sets no cookies and does not follow you across sites. It records the page, referrer, browser type and country, in aggregate.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Microsoft Clarity is used for anonymous usage analytics.</p>
      <p>This build does not run advertising pixels.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Microsoft Clarity sets first-party cookies (_clck and _clsk) to measure anonymous usage. Cloudflare Web Analytics sets no cookies. No other cookies are set.</p>

      <h2>Your choices and requests</h2>
      <p>
        To ask what we hold about you, or to have it corrected or deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy by posting a new version on this page and changing the date above.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
